[[Warrior Ascalon armor]] is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as starter armor and it is also available in the Factions campaign. It can only be crafted up to [[armor rating]] 59 in Prophecies, but can be crafted in Factions up to max armor rating. The helm is only available without attribute bonus in Prophecies, but with any warrior attribute in Factions.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Ascalon armor.

'''Note:''' The starter helm is named "Recruit's Cap" and the rest of the starter pieces are named "Ringmail".

